      "content": "The core justification is that the long-term catastrophic costs of inaction—climate change, extreme weather, and resource scarcity—vastly outweigh any temporary economic discomfort. Prioritizing the rapid phase-out is a necessary investment in planetary stability, which is the ultimate economic foundation. Delaying action only guarantees exponentially higher costs down the line, making the immediate transition a fiscally responsible imperative.",
